tion((r01, [0,1]), (r23, [2,3])).real))\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"numpy ref01 -0.5548498654262386 ref23 -0.6 sum -1.1548498654262387\ntc ind 01: -0.5548498630523682\ntc ind 23: -0.6000000238418579\ntc combined raw: 0.3329099714756012\ntc combined nodes: 0.3329099714756012\ntc combined reshaped: 0.3329099714756012\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
